{"c":{"347650":["Axel Gilberto","Male","b347650-ZpFQEKELOjB1.png","Parkour specialist originally from Brazil. He has outstanding physical abilities and is a quick thinker, who can fly through the city like a bird. He is famous for his numerous jailbreaks.",298],"347652":["Doug Hadine","Male","b347652-UXjjimnDGBL1.png","Originally from Nigeria. He's an intelligent man who creates strategies as the brains of the team, and hides his warm heart behind a calm and collected demeanor. As a student, he studied physics and had a great respect for Dr. Skinner.",73],"347653":["Christine Blake","Female","b347653-7BXgNEvYpFdR.png","Originally from Russia. She has a lively and frank personality, allowing her to get along with anyone. She acts as a gun specialist, who can use any type of gun. She is also a heavy drinker and optimist.",150],"347654":["Leland Astor","Male","b347654-Bpi99oPfoRc9.png","Originally from Canada. His special skill is piloting drones. He seems like a normal dumb middle school student, but has a complicated family situation which is kept secret. He is skilled at reading the room but never says his real intentions. His hobby is ego surfing.",51],"347655":["Eleina","Female","b347655-Wyp59rqfqjnW.png","Originally from Hong Kong. Although she seems unsociable and is bad at listening to what others say, she is actually a famous hacker under the name \"Mad Screamer.\"",123],"347656":["Hersch Lindemann","Female","b347656-cklmgL57PMZE.png","Leader of Lazarus. She has a lot of influence on both nations and large corporations, and does her job without being carried away by emotions. She is an angry and terrifying woman.",11],"347657":["Abel Anderson","Male","b347657-gGHo7jP7eNXO.png","Director of the National Security Agency (NSA). He is always unfazed, calm, and rational, to the point his colleagues questioned if he is secretly an AI.",4],"347658":["Deniz Skinner","Male","b347658-DEAsfbRjQINI.png","Skinner is a three-time Nobel Prize winning scientist. He suddenly d